<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian August yr/yr inflation 1.8 pct vs 1.9.</title>
<headline>Austrian August yr/yr inflation 1.8 pct vs 1.9.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	  AUGUST	 JULY	 AUG '95</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index rise	 0.5	  0.9	     0.5</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation	     1.8	  1.9	     2.1</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	    132.4	131.8	   130.1</p>
<p>NOTES -- previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
